{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>無綫年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》昨日隆重舉行，前港姐季軍王敏慈以一襲淺藍色平口露肩連身晚裝踏上紅地氈。不過她身上某個部位呈現極度筆挺狀態，誇張線條瞬間成為全場焦點。這種極致不自然狀態在網絡上引發極大震撼與熱議。</p>\n<h2>王敏慈紅地氈晚裝展現極致直角肩線條</h2>\n<p>昨日盛典現場星光熠熠，她身穿淺藍色金屬光澤晚裝現身紅地氈環節，頸部配有同材質頸飾點綴。這套充滿仙氣且高貴大方晚裝原本為她增添不少魅力，但露肩設計卻意外將她極為平直雙肩線條完全展露人前。從現場多角度畫面可見，她雙肩呈現出極度筆挺直角狀態，肩頸輪廓彷彿被精確切割，在燈光下顯得異常搶眼。</p>\n<h2>王敏慈畢業後全情投入拓展中港演藝事業</h2>\n<p>面對外界對其外型各種討論，她一直將重心放在專業發展上，並未讓輿論影響步伐。早在2023年奪得《香港小姐競選》季軍後，她選擇返回北京中央戲劇學院繼續深造表演系學位，藉此提升個人演技水準。近日她已順利完成大學課程畢業，並積極於中港兩地拓展演藝版圖，用實際行動展現對演藝事業熱誠與專業態度。</p>\n<h2>積極參演《雨霖鈴》等多部內地重頭劇集</h2>\n<p>在求學期間她已積極兼顧幕前工作，並開始參與多部內地影視劇拍攝，累積豐富實戰經驗。其參演作品陣容鼎盛，當中包括與楊洋合作《雨霖鈴》、與肖戰合演《諜報上不封頂》，以及與秦嵐共同參與《閃耀如她》。這些參與大型製作經歷不僅豐富其履歷，更讓她有機會與多位頂級演員同台交手，進一步磨練演技。</p>\n<h2>誇張肩頸輪廓惹大批網民留言質疑不自然</h2>\n<p>紅地氈相片在網絡上曝光後，隨即引發大批網民熱烈討論。許多觀眾對此肩頸線條感到驚訝，紛紛留言表達看法。部分網民認為其直角程度略顯誇張，直指「真係有啲誇張」，甚至有人留言詢問「點解可以咁直」。各種留言排山倒海而至，焦點全數集中在該部位線條是否過於人工化，讓這套紅地氈造型成為全晚熱話。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515978893831743_11503096206afff6ed5dc1b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6053337241133716288.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515978893831743_11503096206afff6ed5dc1b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lovelle.minci）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515978992663964_14791495306afff6ee4535a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6053337241133716289.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515978992663964_14791495306afff6ee4535a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lovelle.minci）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515979078221725_4597616486afff6ef56f04.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6053337241133716290.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515979078221725_4597616486afff6ef56f04.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lovelle.minci）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515979217852674_18468343646afff6f07b978.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6053337241133716287.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179515979217852674_18468343646afff6f07b978.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lovelle.minci）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951597929386749_6580303216afff6f168504.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6053337241133716291.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17951597929386749_6580303216afff6f168504.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@lovelle.minci）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:44:01.726298+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1083,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:29:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:37:21.840291+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T07:37:26.537637+00:00","content_hash":"e658f6d58cba760908a2e8f500689354ef8b487d35335d4b434d271e687e7d73","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}